- [ ] Have dispatchers spot-check this week's schedule for leftover duplicates and report to Tom — Owen Price, due Oct 7, 2026
- [ ] Have Fernhollow's billing person void the two draft invoices created from duplicate jobs — Owen Price, due Oct 9, 2026

